WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:06,180
I won't cause any trouble for her. That's fine.

2
00:00:06,180 --> 00:00:09,220
Then we can reach a consensus, okay?

3
00:00:09,220 --> 00:00:17,170
The supplies have been distributed

4
00:00:17,170 --> 00:00:19,170
Why did you forget me too?

5
00:00:19,170 --> 00:00:23,380
I haven't forgotten you

6
00:00:25,910 --> 00:00:27,910
You two never had it

7
00:00:27,910 --> 00:00:35,220
You're usually joking with Qin'er, right?

8
00:00:35,220 --> 00:00:36,930
this is not true

9
00:00:36,930 --> 00:00:38,930
You wouldn't treat me like this

10
00:00:38,930 --> 00:00:43,430
Didn't you say you like Qin'er?

11
00:00:43,430 --> 00:00:46,660
I said I like you but

12
00:00:46,660 --> 00:00:47,660
You don't take it seriously, do you?

13
00:00:47,660 --> 00:00:50,260
Please don't come over to bother me in the future.

14
00:00:50,260 --> 00:00:52,490
I already have a girlfriend
